(3998825, 569903, 77195, '<td valign="top">i think this should be in the rural section, but none the less, WOW.</td>', 'i think this should be in the rural section, but none the less, WOW.', '2007-08-15 01:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998836, 568953, 81365, '<td valign="top">doesnt really feel all that "urban" to me</td>', 'doesnt really feel all that "urban" to me', '2007-08-15 01:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998837, 571195, 66515, '<td valign="top">Ow! Ow! Waaay oversaturated! This submission all but glows!</td>', 'Ow! Ow! Waaay oversaturated! This submission all but glows!', '2007-08-15 01:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998841, 571778, 62318, '<td valign="top">No vote from me as I think you may have put this in the wrong challenge. Well, at least I am missing the urban part.<br/> <br/>A DNMC in my book means no vote.</td>', 'No vote from me as I think you may have put this in the wrong challenge. Well, at least I am missing the urban part. A DNMC in my book means no vote.', '2007-08-15 01:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998842, 571427, 13207, '<td valign="top">Neat - great contrast - love how clear the lights are in the buildings against the blur of the car lights and the sky is wonderful.</td>', 'Neat - great contrast - love how clear the lights are in the buildings against the blur of the car lights and the sky is wonderful.', '2007-08-15 01:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998847, 570046, 81365, '<td valign="top">This shot hurts my head :)</td>', 'This shot hurts my head :)', '2007-08-15 01:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998851, 571456, 81365, '<td valign="top">love how the church is not distorted near as much as the other building.</td>', 'love how the church is not distorted near as much as the other building.', '2007-08-15 01:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998853, 569173, 13207, '<td valign="top">Sky''s a little blah for me and there seems to be some noisy spots around the buildings but you captured the reflections of the lights in the water excellently.</td>', 'Sky''s a little blah for me and there seems to be some noisy spots around the buildings but you captured the reflections of the lights in the water excellently.', '2007-08-15 01:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998858, 570083, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the sky and the waving flag. This could use some straightening. A different angle would be helpful here too. The straight on shot of the Husky is a little bland. The Husky''s a great piece of Canadiana however and that lends a lot of appeal to me for this shot.</td>', 'I like the sky and the waving flag. This could use some straightening. A different angle would be helpful here too. The straight on shot of the Husky is a little bland. The Husky''s a great piece of Canadiana however and that lends a lot of appeal to me for this shot.', '2007-08-15 01:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998859, 570226, 37930, '<td valign="top">The colors are a bit dull and it looks a little out of focus, but it''s a neat perspective. I think some more post processing could have made this much nicer looking.</td>', 'The colors are a bit dull and it looks a little out of focus, but it''s a neat perspective. I think some more post processing could have made this much nicer looking.', '2007-08-15 01:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998861, 568940, 81365, '<td valign="top">The drop of color just pulls me in immediately.</td>', 'The drop of color just pulls me in immediately.', '2007-08-15 01:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998862, 571479, 40718, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to take a dip.  Then dip again.  That would be a double dip... ;) (no vote)</td>', 'Makes me want to take a dip.  Then dip again.  That would be a double dip... ;) (no vote)', '2007-08-15 01:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998868, 571956, 13207, '<td valign="top">Wow - amazing capture - I especially love the fact that you included the clear sky above the storm clouds.  Great job!</td>', 'Wow - amazing capture - I especially love the fact that you included the clear sky above the storm clouds.  Great job!', '2007-08-15 01:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998874, 570776, 81365, '<td valign="top">I like how you can see down that one street with all its lights. Good cap.</td>', 'I like how you can see down that one street with all its lights. Good cap.', '2007-08-15 01:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998875, 571793, 37930, '<td valign="top">Very nice looking shot, though I don''t think this is an urban landscape any more than a tree trunk would be a rural landscape. Also, if the sign stood out more it might add to the image. Not meaning to complain or talk down your photo, it''s very aesthetically pleasing.</td>', 'Very nice looking shot, though I don''t think this is an urban landscape any more than a tree trunk would be a rural landscape. Also, if the sign stood out more it might add to the image. Not meaning to complain or talk down your photo, it''s very aesthetically pleasing.', '2007-08-15 01:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998882, 571928, 66515, '<td valign="top">Exposing for the sky (especially the clouds) would add some "zing" ot the shot. Good sharpness (nearly oversharpened however). Seeing more of the street would create stronger leading lines through the scene. The line ends rather abuptly with this composition. I like the reflections in the building. A bit stronger contrast would help.</td>', 'Exposing for the sky (especially the clouds) would add some "zing" ot the shot. Good sharpness (nearly oversharpened however). Seeing more of the street would create stronger leading lines through the scene. The line ends rather abuptly with this composition. I like the reflections in the building. A bit stronger contrast would help.', '2007-08-15 01:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998883, 570734, 62318, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm, interesting. What tower bridge is this? It isn''t the one in London. Cool mimicry.</td>', 'Hmmmm, interesting. What tower bridge is this? It isn''t the one in London. Cool mimicry.', '2007-08-15 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998885, 571020, 81365, '<td valign="top">doesn''t feel very urban to me. So much grass and nature vs the rails and bridge, but I do like the picture.</td>', 'doesn''t feel very urban to me. So much grass and nature vs the rails and bridge, but I do like the picture.', '2007-08-15 01:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998888, 571778, 37930, '<td valign="top">Better suited for the rural landscapes challenge I think, though I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt that this was taken at least close to an urban area. Quite a beautiful scene though I think if more mountain was in the frame and it was focused more sharply, it would be an excellent shot.</td>', 'Better suited for the rural landscapes challenge I think, though I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt that this was taken at least close to an urban area. Quite a beautiful scene though I think if more mountain was in the frame and it was focused more sharply, it would be an excellent shot.', '2007-08-15 01:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998890, 571900, 81365, '<td valign="top">So much of the same look until the tower and the dome structure. Such color.</td>', 'So much of the same look until the tower and the dome structure. Such color.', '2007-08-15 01:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998893, 571704, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice colors especially in the sky. I like the silhouette you''ve created at the bottom of the scene and you captured the lighting terrifically. I would consider cropping a little off the bottom but this is a great capture overall.</td>', 'Nice colors especially in the sky. I like the silhouette you''ve created at the bottom of the scene and you captured the lighting terrifically. I would consider cropping a little off the bottom but this is a great capture overall.', '2007-08-15 01:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998899, 568374, 81365, '<td valign="top">I like the work with the colors. It really does change the feeling to an older one.</td>', 'I like the work with the colors. It really does change the feeling to an older one.', '2007-08-15 01:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998902, 571670, 13207, '<td valign="top">Very graphic shot - the way it''s almost a black &amp; white but for the little spots of colour on the flowers.  And although I''m not usually a fan of frames, what you''ve done to this really suits the picture.</td>', 'Very graphic shot - the way it''s almost a black & white but for the little spots of colour on the flowers.  And although I''m not usually a fan of frames, what you''ve done to this really suits the picture.', '2007-08-15 01:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998908, 569480, 81365, '<td valign="top">Tree looks barely alive :)</td>', 'Tree looks barely alive :)', '2007-08-15 01:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998923, 571341, 73494, '<td valign="top">i love the long focal length on this shot, it compresses the elements for a nice effect.</td>', 'i love the long focal length on this shot, it compresses the elements for a nice effect.', '2007-08-15 01:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3998925, 571268, 37930, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, which is quite a feat considering it''s Calgary. Go Oilers! (This doesn''t affect my vote, don''t worry =) Sharp and nicely exposed.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, which is quite a feat considering it''s Calgary. Go Oilers! (This doesn''t affect my vote, don''t worry =) Sharp and nicely exposed.', '2007-08-15 01:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
