(3999121, 571199, 81365, '<td valign="top">light seems weird. flashes?</td>', 'light seems weird. flashes?', '2007-08-15 01:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999125, 571853, 81365, '<td valign="top">the water looks like melted metal, I really enjoy this picture.</td>', 'the water looks like melted metal, I really enjoy this picture.', '2007-08-15 01:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999132, 571699, 81365, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective</td>', 'interesting perspective', '2007-08-15 01:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999155, 570206, 78021, '<td valign="top">I see I was not the only one in Rome last week. ;-)  Nice shot, but I''m not sure how much of a landscape this is...unless the landscape is hidden behinde the building. ;-)</td>', 'I see I was not the only one in Rome last week. ;-)  Nice shot, but I''m not sure how much of a landscape this is...unless the landscape is hidden behinde the building. ;-)', '2007-08-15 01:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999156, 570781, 66515, '<td valign="top">This could use a quick touchup of levels and/or curves. Nothing''s really black and nothing is white. I would include more of the building on the righr as well. Otherwise I like the composition and the colors are quite nice.</td>', 'This could use a quick touchup of levels and/or curves. Nothing''s really black and nothing is white. I would include more of the building on the righr as well. Otherwise I like the composition and the colors are quite nice.', '2007-08-15 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999167, 570192, 66515, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a little oversaturated particularly under the bridge. Lowering the camera a bit would get rid of the branch in the top left hand corner. I like the light trails on the road.</td>', 'The colors seem a little oversaturated particularly under the bridge. Lowering the camera a bit would get rid of the branch in the top left hand corner. I like the light trails on the road.', '2007-08-15 02:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999177, 569337, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors however they are a bit oversaturated. (This is evident in the trees.) I don''t really care for building extending through the top of the frame however. It feels somewhat "chopped" <br/> <br/>The overall composition itself is kinda strange too. Based on the title I know I am supposed to be looking at the building. However the composition doesn''t really lend to this.</td>', 'Interesting colors however they are a bit oversaturated. (This is evident in the trees.) I don''t really care for building extending through the top of the frame however. It feels somewhat "chopped"  The overall composition itself is kinda strange too. Based on the title I know I am supposed to be looking at the building. However the composition doesn''t really lend to this.', '2007-08-15 02:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999183, 569480, 66515, '<td valign="top">This really doesn''t say landscape to me unfortunately. That aside the silhouette is nice. I would have tried to get more of it in the frame perhaps. If you had exposed for the sky too you may have been able to pull more detail out of it.</td>', 'This really doesn''t say landscape to me unfortunately. That aside the silhouette is nice. I would have tried to get more of it in the frame perhaps. If you had exposed for the sky too you may have been able to pull more detail out of it.', '2007-08-15 02:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999196, 571921, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting starbursts on the lights. (I assume this effect was created by a filter and not done in post). I feel like something is missing from the shot however. The angle seems pretty much straight on my eye is left to wander about on its own.</td>', 'Interesting starbursts on the lights. (I assume this effect was created by a filter and not done in post). I feel like something is missing from the shot however. The angle seems pretty much straight on my eye is left to wander about on its own.', '2007-08-15 02:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999212, 571778, 78021, '<td valign="top">Urban?</td>', 'Urban?', '2007-08-15 02:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999229, 569138, 78021, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to realize what I was looking at.  Creative angle...making something that would otherwise be plain become interesting. :-)</td>', 'Took me a second to realize what I was looking at.  Creative angle...making something that would otherwise be plain become interesting. :-)', '2007-08-15 02:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999238, 569337, 78021, '<td valign="top">You are right, that building looks like a PS3...weird.  But not much of a landscape.</td>', 'You are right, that building looks like a PS3...weird.  But not much of a landscape.', '2007-08-15 02:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999240, 571990, 66515, '<td valign="top">Oh wow! That''s the first reaction even when I saw the thumbnail. I love the bold dramatic sky and the way you captured the lights. The reflections effectively add foreground interest with taking your eye away from the skyline. I like the subtle details of this shot. (The cranes with their lights on them is an example) Really this is the type of shot I wish I had taken. I imagine there was some PP involved but it doesn''t look over processed. <br/> <br/>Wow...</td>', 'Oh wow! That''s the first reaction even when I saw the thumbnail. I love the bold dramatic sky and the way you captured the lights. The reflections effectively add foreground interest with taking your eye away from the skyline. I like the subtle details of this shot. (The cranes with their lights on them is an example) Really this is the type of shot I wish I had taken. I imagine there was some PP involved but it doesn''t look over processed.  Wow...', '2007-08-15 02:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999246, 571823, 66515, '<td valign="top">Hmm...tough call on this. Arthur''s Seat, from my recollection is just outside of Edinburgh so its more rural than urban. (Now if you were take the shot from the walls of Edinburgh Castle that would be different)<br/> <br/>That aside, I love the sky and the silhouette you captured here.  The clouds take your eye throughout the frame quite nicely. The silhouette leads the eye to the travellers in the corner just quietly but effectively tucked away.</td>', 'Hmm...tough call on this. Arthur''s Seat, from my recollection is just outside of Edinburgh so its more rural than urban. (Now if you were take the shot from the walls of Edinburgh Castle that would be different) That aside, I love the sky and the silhouette you captured here.  The clouds take your eye throughout the frame quite nicely. The silhouette leads the eye to the travellers in the corner just quietly but effectively tucked away.', '2007-08-15 02:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999265, 571138, 78021, '<td valign="top">Rolling stones songs was the chalange a few weeks ago...wasn''t it?</td>', 'Rolling stones songs was the chalange a few weeks ago...wasn''t it?', '2007-08-15 02:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999285, 570996, 78021, '<td valign="top">Yet another in Rome this week. :-)  I took shots in the same area this week, but none turned out that nicely.  Perfect angle getting both the forum and colesseum ruins in  a single shot, nice lighting contrast between the background and foreground.  It truly amaized me at the scale of those buildings in the ruins. (first time to Rome)</td>', 'Yet another in Rome this week. :-)  I took shots in the same area this week, but none turned out that nicely.  Perfect angle getting both the forum and colesseum ruins in  a single shot, nice lighting contrast between the background and foreground.  It truly amaized me at the scale of those buildings in the ruins. (first time to Rome)', '2007-08-15 02:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999290, 571483, 79604, '<td valign="top">Great cityscape! Composition, focus and colors are wonderful. Sky color sets the buildings off nicely.</td>', 'Great cityscape! Composition, focus and colors are wonderful. Sky color sets the buildings off nicely.', '2007-08-15 02:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
