(4000552, 571017, 74605, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene.  The light here is very nice, and the reflections in the water work well.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Pretty scene.  The light here is very nice, and the reflections in the water work well.  Nicely done.', '2007-08-15 11:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000554, 569027, 68197, '<td valign="top">For some the motion blurs might be distracting, not for me. I would like to see this with a rear curtain synch flash.</td>', 'For some the motion blurs might be distracting, not for me. I would like to see this with a rear curtain synch flash.', '2007-08-15 11:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000558, 571479, 74605, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  The whole scene is magical!  Very well done.  A 10 from me.</td>', 'Great shot.  The whole scene is magical!  Very well done.  A 10 from me.', '2007-08-15 11:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000561, 570775, 68197, '<td valign="top">Technique is good. She looks as if she is modeling.</td>', 'Technique is good. She looks as if she is modeling.', '2007-08-15 11:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000564, 571921, 74605, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene.</td>', 'Pretty scene.', '2007-08-15 11:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000565, 571020, 68197, '<td valign="top">With the focus sharp front to back i invites following the old track.</td>', 'With the focus sharp front to back i invites following the old track.', '2007-08-15 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000567, 568181, 68197, '<td valign="top">Urban billboard, almost.</td>', 'Urban billboard, almost.', '2007-08-15 11:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000568, 571704, 74605, '<td valign="top">Beautiful building and you have captured it well.  The lighting on it is wonderful.  Nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful building and you have captured it well.  The lighting on it is wonderful.  Nice work.', '2007-08-15 11:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000576, 569804, 74605, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  The bridge against the sky is nice.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  The bridge against the sky is nice.', '2007-08-15 11:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000577, 571298, 74605, '<td valign="top">Nice magical feel.  I like the fog. Well done.</td>', 'Nice magical feel.  I like the fog. Well done.', '2007-08-15 11:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000579, 571268, 74605, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The colors are incredible!  Well done.</td>', 'Very pretty.  The colors are incredible!  Well done.', '2007-08-15 11:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000582, 571195, 68197, '<td valign="top">I see you have an eye of the sophisticate!</td>', 'I see you have an eye of the sophisticate!', '2007-08-15 11:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000583, 571900, 74605, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2007-08-15 11:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000584, 571416, 74605, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Lights and colors are great.  You did a nice job here.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Lights and colors are great.  You did a nice job here.', '2007-08-15 12:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000589, 571138, 68197, '<td valign="top">Perhaps too black, Losing shadow detail completely at the dumpster, at least on my screen. Otherwise, I like the composition.</td>', 'Perhaps too black, Losing shadow detail completely at the dumpster, at least on my screen. Otherwise, I like the composition.', '2007-08-15 12:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000600, 569035, 68197, '<td valign="top">Could be a city advert. Well done: sweeping curvilinear line leading deeper into the landscape, horizon high up in the frame.</td>', 'Could be a city advert. Well done: sweeping curvilinear line leading deeper into the landscape, horizon high up in the frame.', '2007-08-15 12:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000609, 569843, 68197, '<td valign="top">Could be a magazine or city publication photo.</td>', 'Could be a magazine or city publication photo.', '2007-08-15 12:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000631, 570721, 68197, '<td valign="top">"Now approaching...Now leaving..."</td>', '"Now approaching...Now leaving..."', '2007-08-15 12:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000650, 571739, 68197, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed.</td>', 'A bit overexposed.', '2007-08-15 12:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000651, 570449, 68197, '<td valign="top">The first photo in this competition that I''ve stopped for while to explore.  Little stories (no pun intended) to wonder about.</td>', 'The first photo in this competition that I''ve stopped for while to explore.  Little stories (no pun intended) to wonder about.', '2007-08-15 12:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000659, 570381, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W shot.</td>', 'Nice B&W shot.', '2007-08-15 12:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000667, 568568, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, it seems that your horizon is tilted though. Its nice to see that such an incredible structure is being built.</td>', 'Nice photo, it seems that your horizon is tilted though. Its nice to see that such an incredible structure is being built.', '2007-08-15 12:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000672, 571265, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and a nice processing job, just the right amount of contrast to me.</td>', 'Nice colors and a nice processing job, just the right amount of contrast to me.', '2007-08-15 12:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000692, 571340, 71951, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great place to visit.  To me the buildings in the foreground are slightly blurred. It would be nice to see what the camera settins are during the voting process. Without knowing that, for a landscape shot I try to get f16-f22 range to mimic what the eye sees and focus on the foreground subject. In this photo because the building in the lower right in so prominent and being slightly blurred it detracts from the rest of the photo. Great subject matter though.</td>', 'Looks like a great place to visit.  To me the buildings in the foreground are slightly blurred. It would be nice to see what the camera settins are during the voting process. Without knowing that, for a landscape shot I try to get f16-f22 range to mimic what the eye sees and focus on the foreground subject. In this photo because the building in the lower right in so prominent and being slightly blurred it detracts from the rest of the photo. Great subject matter though.', '2007-08-15 12:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000698, 570811, 71951, '<td valign="top">Neat towering billboard on the left. Nice colors in the foreground.</td>', 'Neat towering billboard on the left. Nice colors in the foreground.', '2007-08-15 12:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000703, 571842, 71951, '<td valign="top">great colors and composition.</td>', 'great colors and composition.', '2007-08-15 12:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000715, 569900, 74078, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the colours and the slow shutter speed. Pity about the light scratch, no doubt caused by an aircraft moving overhead. I have suffered from this so many times in a good photo. Luckily, outside the challenge you can clone it out and you will be left with a great shot of Perth city. 8</td>', 'Great shot. Love the colours and the slow shutter speed. Pity about the light scratch, no doubt caused by an aircraft moving overhead. I have suffered from this so many times in a good photo. Luckily, outside the challenge you can clone it out and you will be left with a great shot of Perth city. 8', '2007-08-15 12:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000716, 571272, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, seems slightly dark to me, possibly a longer shutter speed to allow more light in (tricky as to not get a blown sky...a ND filter helps for those slower shutter speeds). I like the bridge in the background and a nice array of colors for visual interest.</td>', 'Nice composition, seems slightly dark to me, possibly a longer shutter speed to allow more light in (tricky as to not get a blown sky...a ND filter helps for those slower shutter speeds). I like the bridge in the background and a nice array of colors for visual interest.', '2007-08-15 12:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000721, 571806, 71951, '<td valign="top">Great night photo, lighting seems perfect...I''d like to know what you used for a shutter speed.</td>', 'Great night photo, lighting seems perfect...I''d like to know what you used for a shutter speed.', '2007-08-15 12:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000725, 571486, 79562, '<td valign="top">great color!</td>', 'great color!', '2007-08-15 12:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000728, 569337, 71951, '<td valign="top">A cool looking building...too bad part of it''s cut off. I think a wider angle would have helped because the colors are great, the blues and copper/browns highlight each other nicely and you have a great subject to photograph. A very sharp photo as well.</td>', 'A cool looking building...too bad part of it''s cut off. I think a wider angle would have helped because the colors are great, the blues and copper/browns highlight each other nicely and you have a great subject to photograph. A very sharp photo as well.', '2007-08-15 12:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000731, 571094, 71951, '<td valign="top">I love photo''s like this, nice colors, interesting subject matter. I think this would probably look great in B&amp;W as well.</td>', 'I love photo''s like this, nice colors, interesting subject matter. I think this would probably look great in B&W as well.', '2007-08-15 12:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000736, 570362, 71951, '<td valign="top">With the great sky color I think this is a great use of negative space. I bet this would make for a great panorama as well. Nicely done.</td>', 'With the great sky color I think this is a great use of negative space. I bet this would make for a great panorama as well. Nicely done.', '2007-08-15 12:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000737, 571693, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, interesting yard.</td>', 'Nice contrast, interesting yard.', '2007-08-15 12:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000740, 572011, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, lots of interesting subjects with great colors.</td>', 'Nice photo, lots of interesting subjects with great colors.', '2007-08-15 12:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000830, 572000, 30049, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the movie "Astronaut Farmer".  Looks like Farmer is ready to launch his space rocket out of that barn.  :)</td>', 'Reminds me of the movie "Astronaut Farmer".  Looks like Farmer is ready to launch his space rocket out of that barn.  :)', '2007-08-15 12:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000841, 571729, 30049, '<td valign="top">Is this from one of the canyon roads off of PCH?  It looks familiar, but it''s been years (early 80''s) since I''ve been there.  Beverly Glen maybe?  Mulholland?  Hmmm...I''ll have to check back after the challenge is over.<br/> <br/>BTW, I like the POV and your take on this challenge theme.  Good luck.</td>', 'Is this from one of the canyon roads off of PCH?  It looks familiar, but it''s been years (early 80''s) since I''ve been there.  Beverly Glen maybe?  Mulholland?  Hmmm...I''ll have to check back after the challenge is over. BTW, I like the POV and your take on this challenge theme.  Good luck.', '2007-08-15 12:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000860, 571917, 56880, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern of the shrub things on the steps, but the upper right is just too empty.</td>', 'I like the pattern of the shrub things on the steps, but the upper right is just too empty.', '2007-08-15 13:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4000861, 571683, 56880, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot, but it looks a little flat.</td>', 'Nice night shot, but it looks a little flat.', '2007-08-15 13:07:46.000000', NULL, 1);
