(4002623, 571317, 58691, '<td valign="top">the focus looks a bit soft, but the smoothness of the water and the reflection is outstanding. You could''ve submitted this for the upside-down challenge as well.</td>', 'the focus looks a bit soft, but the smoothness of the water and the reflection is outstanding. You could''ve submitted this for the upside-down challenge as well.', '2007-08-15 23:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
