(4002629, 569477, 56880, '<td valign="top">I like the uneven reflection better than if the water had been completely still.  Given how washed the sky was, pushing the horizon up a bit was a good move too.</td>', 'I like the uneven reflection better than if the water had been completely still.  Given how washed the sky was, pushing the horizon up a bit was a good move too.', '2007-08-15 23:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002634, 570449, 58691, '<td valign="top">Well done! I see 12 different stories in this image.</td>', 'Well done! I see 12 different stories in this image.', '2007-08-15 23:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002638, 571326, 58691, '<td valign="top">Where is this, I want to shoot it for the Wings challenge. :) <br/> <br/>I like the lines, but I think it could''ve used a tad more contrast.</td>', 'Where is this, I want to shoot it for the Wings challenge. :)  I like the lines, but I think it could''ve used a tad more contrast.', '2007-08-15 23:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002641, 568940, 56880, '<td valign="top">Great pattern shot, helped by the tilted perspective and the lone pair of flower pots.  This is one of my favorites in the whole challenge.</td>', 'Great pattern shot, helped by the tilted perspective and the lone pair of flower pots.  This is one of my favorites in the whole challenge.', '2007-08-15 23:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002642, 571823, 58691, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t it have gone in the rural challenge instead of the urban? nice shot, though.</td>', 'Shouldn''t it have gone in the rural challenge instead of the urban? nice shot, though.', '2007-08-15 23:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002645, 571341, 56880, '<td valign="top">Invasion of the walking power grid!</td>', 'Invasion of the walking power grid!', '2007-08-15 23:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002649, 570981, 56880, '<td valign="top">The person being in motion looks good, but the steps themselves look blurred too.</td>', 'The person being in motion looks good, but the steps themselves look blurred too.', '2007-08-15 23:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002650, 571416, 58691, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen Pittsburgh look that good... Go Browns!</td>', 'I''ve never seen Pittsburgh look that good... Go Browns!', '2007-08-15 23:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002653, 571879, 58691, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but I am not a fan of the greenish tint.</td>', 'nice shot, but I am not a fan of the greenish tint.', '2007-08-15 23:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002662, 568892, 58691, '<td valign="top">The black areas hurt this image - without definition, there is very little interest from the eye.</td>', 'The black areas hurt this image - without definition, there is very little interest from the eye.', '2007-08-15 23:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002663, 569138, 56880, '<td valign="top">It took me a second to realize what this was.  Good repeating pattern though, nice shot.</td>', 'It took me a second to realize what this was.  Good repeating pattern though, nice shot.', '2007-08-15 23:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002667, 571427, 58691, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I love how you captured so many colors in the motion trail.</td>', 'Nice shot. I love how you captured so many colors in the motion trail.', '2007-08-15 23:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002671, 569943, 56880, '<td valign="top">Urban macro landscape!  The bolt in the wall screams "urban".</td>', 'Urban macro landscape!  The bolt in the wall screams "urban".', '2007-08-15 23:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002677, 568742, 58691, '<td valign="top">The back-hoe looks like it is floating on a black fog. There is no definition under the Komatsu.</td>', 'The back-hoe looks like it is floating on a black fog. There is no definition under the Komatsu.', '2007-08-15 23:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002688, 571486, 58691, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it Helsingborg? love the city, love your shot. Great colors.</td>', 'Isn''t it Helsingborg? love the city, love your shot. Great colors.', '2007-08-15 23:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002737, 569138, 66494, '<td valign="top">Very unique and artistic. 10</td>', 'Very unique and artistic. 10', '2007-08-15 23:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002741, 569027, 66494, '<td valign="top">Jeffrey??</td>', 'Jeffrey??', '2007-08-15 23:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002772, 570783, 74979, '<td valign="top">juxtaposition strikes me as odd.  I like each part of this image indiviually, but together...um, not so much.  Nice airplane trail(?) you captured along the top of the building there!</td>', 'juxtaposition strikes me as odd.  I like each part of this image indiviually, but together...um, not so much.  Nice airplane trail(?) you captured along the top of the building there!', '2007-08-15 23:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002774, 571465, 74979, '<td valign="top">lovely building! nicely rendered here.</td>', 'lovely building! nicely rendered here.', '2007-08-15 23:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002784, 571693, 66494, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Love the feline on the aban. 8ndoned cars and the huge expanse of green. 9</td>', 'Great capture. Love the feline on the aban. 8ndoned cars and the huge expanse of green. 9', '2007-08-15 23:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002803, 571479, 66494, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft romantic shot. 10</td>', 'Beautiful soft romantic shot. 10', '2007-08-16 00:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002828, 570046, 74979, '<td valign="top">nice blur action here, with the "bright lights big city" feel to it, really gets across the frenetic rhythm of a city! if I were to say anything "negative", it''s that the lights seem almost too bright, particularly at center screen, but it''s also late &amp; I don''t party like I used to!</td>', 'nice blur action here, with the "bright lights big city" feel to it, really gets across the frenetic rhythm of a city! if I were to say anything "negative", it''s that the lights seem almost too bright, particularly at center screen, but it''s also late & I don''t party like I used to!', '2007-08-16 00:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002837, 569138, 64446, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful composition and pattern...</td>', 'What a beautiful composition and pattern...', '2007-08-16 00:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002945, 570046, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot but knowing where you are shooting I think I''d prefer a nice sharp picture. Not one that was taken while you were walking. You have good colors, a decent composition but the wavy effect doesn''t work here. <br/> <br/>Sorry.</td>', 'Interesting shot but knowing where you are shooting I think I''d prefer a nice sharp picture. Not one that was taken while you were walking. You have good colors, a decent composition but the wavy effect doesn''t work here.  Sorry.', '2007-08-16 00:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003179, 571981, 22301, '<td valign="top">cool, I seems like you are up by the coastguard tower at the top of TI. I think zooming would have made more interesting but I also like the wide perspective.</td>', 'cool, I seems like you are up by the coastguard tower at the top of TI. I think zooming would have made more interesting but I also like the wide perspective.', '2007-08-16 02:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003181, 571341, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love it. The giants (with the huge spiderweb) standing in the background, the town along a single road, and especially the very subtle neutral shades.</td>', 'Love it. The giants (with the huge spiderweb) standing in the background, the town along a single road, and especially the very subtle neutral shades.', '2007-08-16 02:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003186, 571290, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and such an interesting contrast between the structures.</td>', 'Beautiful tones and such an interesting contrast between the structures.', '2007-08-16 02:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003190, 570756, 22301, '<td valign="top">Is this EstimatedEyes? I am very familiar with this spot ;-)</td>', 'Is this EstimatedEyes? I am very familiar with this spot ;-)', '2007-08-16 02:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003192, 569595, 22301, '<td valign="top">Is this out in Oakland? I like the the different layers you created from the pebbles, rocks, water wood pylons to the big StarWars looking things to the sky, very nice.</td>', 'Is this out in Oakland? I like the the different layers you created from the pebbles, rocks, water wood pylons to the big StarWars looking things to the sky, very nice.', '2007-08-16 02:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003193, 570906, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast effect.</td>', 'I like the high contrast effect.', '2007-08-16 02:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003195, 571817, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely bird portrait, but not what I would consider a Landscape.</td>', 'Lovely bird portrait, but not what I would consider a Landscape.', '2007-08-16 02:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003197, 571486, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the processing. It looks like an old fashion postcard.</td>', 'I like the processing. It looks like an old fashion postcard.', '2007-08-16 02:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003198, 571427, 22301, '<td valign="top">very cool, those clouds rock and the lines from the cars give a nice rigidness the flowing clouds.</td>', 'very cool, those clouds rock and the lines from the cars give a nice rigidness the flowing clouds.', '2007-08-16 02:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003200, 569968, 66384, '<td valign="top">It seems to be tilted and in need of a levels adjustment</td>', 'It seems to be tilted and in need of a levels adjustment', '2007-08-16 02:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003207, 571956, 66384, '<td valign="top">Not marking it down for this, but it seems like it would fit better in the Rural Landscape challenge. I think it''s an marvelous capture of a very stormy sky. Love the layers of the starry blue, the roiling clouds, the natural and artificial light, and the silhouette of the earth.</td>', 'Not marking it down for this, but it seems like it would fit better in the Rural Landscape challenge. I think it''s an marvelous capture of a very stormy sky. Love the layers of the starry blue, the roiling clouds, the natural and artificial light, and the silhouette of the earth.', '2007-08-16 02:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003222, 569138, 66384, '<td valign="top">Neat image! Interesting idea -- turning it sideways. I like the pattern.</td>', 'Neat image! Interesting idea -- turning it sideways. I like the pattern.', '2007-08-16 02:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003226, 569477, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflection. I especially like the clouds in the water.</td>', 'Beautiful reflection. I especially like the clouds in the water.', '2007-08-16 02:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003228, 571432, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the patterns. You must be a chimney sweep. :)</td>', 'Love the patterns. You must be a chimney sweep. :)', '2007-08-16 02:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003233, 570083, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think you''re right. That''s quite a sky. I wish the image were a little sharper and more vibrant.</td>', 'I think you''re right. That''s quite a sky. I wish the image were a little sharper and more vibrant.', '2007-08-16 02:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003237, 568289, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful portrait, but I really don''t see how it fits in a Landscape challenge.</td>', 'This is a wonderful portrait, but I really don''t see how it fits in a Landscape challenge.', '2007-08-16 02:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003240, 571200, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of the buildings.</td>', 'I like the colors of the buildings.', '2007-08-16 02:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003242, 570362, 66384, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2007-08-16 02:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003246, 571778, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. It seems like it should be in the Rural Landscape challenge.</td>', 'Very nice image. It seems like it should be in the Rural Landscape challenge.', '2007-08-16 02:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003247, 569173, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love the shine.</td>', 'I love the shine.', '2007-08-16 02:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003249, 569476, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I do not understand how this fits in a Landscape challenge.</td>', 'I''m afraid I do not understand how this fits in a Landscape challenge.', '2007-08-16 02:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003255, 571816, 66384, '<td valign="top">I would like this better with the street cropped off.</td>', 'I would like this better with the street cropped off.', '2007-08-16 03:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003264, 571991, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice tones.</td>', 'Nice tones.', '2007-08-16 03:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003270, 570775, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, but IMO it doesn''t belong in a landscape challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful image, but IMO it doesn''t belong in a landscape challenge.', '2007-08-16 03:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003272, 569325, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and charming.</td>', 'Beautiful and charming.', '2007-08-16 03:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003313, 571778, 68514, '<td valign="top">Uhmm... i really do not define this an urban landscape.</td>', 'Uhmm... i really do not define this an urban landscape.', '2007-08-16 04:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003316, 571486, 68514, '<td valign="top">I don''t like very much HDR, but this pic is nice. 6</td>', 'I don''t like very much HDR, but this pic is nice. 6', '2007-08-16 04:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003324, 571795, 66515, '<td valign="top">Its a great picture of a tree that''s been spoiled by a landscape. Or a landscape with a tree hogging the foreground. I think you had a nice landscape to shoot but you might have gotten a little greedy by plunking the tree in the foreground.</td>', 'Its a great picture of a tree that''s been spoiled by a landscape. Or a landscape with a tree hogging the foreground. I think you had a nice landscape to shoot but you might have gotten a little greedy by plunking the tree in the foreground.', '2007-08-16 04:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003326, 570906, 66515, '<td valign="top">I really like the high contrast black and white you used here. Movie theatres are really good subjects for this kind of treatment so well done on your choice of subject. It looks like you had some harsh lighting so the black and white also helps with that. (i.e. rather than "harsh" lighting it is now "dramatic" lighting).  Interesting angle you shot from.</td>', 'I really like the high contrast black and white you used here. Movie theatres are really good subjects for this kind of treatment so well done on your choice of subject. It looks like you had some harsh lighting so the black and white also helps with that. (i.e. rather than "harsh" lighting it is now "dramatic" lighting).  Interesting angle you shot from.', '2007-08-16 04:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003330, 570996, 66515, '<td valign="top">Really tough shot here due to the lighting. Getting more to the left to include more of the building on the left may have helped or moving right to eliminate it altogether may have also worked. Right now the pillar on the left almost serves as a border and really shrinks the viewing area. Even though there is things to look at to the pillar''s left I really have to force myself to look there.</td>', 'Really tough shot here due to the lighting. Getting more to the left to include more of the building on the left may have helped or moving right to eliminate it altogether may have also worked. Right now the pillar on the left almost serves as a border and really shrinks the viewing area. Even though there is things to look at to the pillar''s left I really have to force myself to look there.', '2007-08-16 04:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003332, 571683, 66515, '<td valign="top">Good capture considering the lighting. I like the colors and the lines you captured here. The angle is pretty good however I might want to see more of the tail light streaks at the bottom. Or none at all? Not sure. <br/> <br/>Well done overall.</td>', 'Good capture considering the lighting. I like the colors and the lines you captured here. The angle is pretty good however I might want to see more of the tail light streaks at the bottom. Or none at all? Not sure.  Well done overall.', '2007-08-16 04:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003336, 571273, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white conversion especially in how the clouds and sky appear. I really like the streak of light in the water. Were it narrower it would divide the image but its width creates a nice pair of lines to the vanishing point. <br/> <br/>The tree on the right really doesn''t fit here. Hard to say how to get rid of it though. Zooming in would reduce the bridge to the left. Moving left would love that line down the middle. Moving forward doesn''t look like an option unless you have a boat or a snorkel. If there is a way to shoot this without the tree to the right I''d like to see it in any event.</td>', 'Nice black and white conversion especially in how the clouds and sky appear. I really like the streak of light in the water. Were it narrower it would divide the image but its width creates a nice pair of lines to the vanishing point.  The tree on the right really doesn''t fit here. Hard to say how to get rid of it though. Zooming in would reduce the bridge to the left. Moving left would love that line down the middle. Moving forward doesn''t look like an option unless you have a boat or a snorkel. If there is a way to shoot this without the tree to the right I''d like to see it in any event.', '2007-08-16 04:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003349, 571933, 66515, '<td valign="top">Needs some straightening I think. I am not sure what to think of the black triangle jutting into the frame in the top right. The lamp post also seems to somewhat blend in so I am left sort of wondering what it is. A bit more contrast would add a bit of punch to the sky which already looks pretty good. Interesting subject and the title suits it well.</td>', 'Needs some straightening I think. I am not sure what to think of the black triangle jutting into the frame in the top right. The lamp post also seems to somewhat blend in so I am left sort of wondering what it is. A bit more contrast would add a bit of punch to the sky which already looks pretty good. Interesting subject and the title suits it well.', '2007-08-16 04:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003350, 571729, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting but not overly so. Taking a picture out of a plane window is okay for wrapping up a trip but its hard to get an effective picture at night. You have the plane''s vibration to deal with not to mention its motion. You are also shooting through a heck of a lot of glass. Consequently its hard to get a shot you are really going to be happy with. (i.e sharp with good exposure and composition).</td>', 'Interesting but not overly so. Taking a picture out of a plane window is okay for wrapping up a trip but its hard to get an effective picture at night. You have the plane''s vibration to deal with not to mention its motion. You are also shooting through a heck of a lot of glass. Consequently its hard to get a shot you are really going to be happy with. (i.e sharp with good exposure and composition).', '2007-08-16 04:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003369, 571432, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great roofs, exceptional point of view, unfortunately the flat sky lets the image down somewhat.</td>', 'Great roofs, exceptional point of view, unfortunately the flat sky lets the image down somewhat.', '2007-08-16 04:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003375, 571456, 78599, '<td valign="top">great reflection!</td>', 'great reflection!', '2007-08-16 05:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003377, 570046, 78599, '<td valign="top">Im not sure how this will score, but I like it...makes me stressed like I get every time I go into a big city...</td>', 'Im not sure how this will score, but I like it...makes me stressed like I get every time I go into a big city...', '2007-08-16 05:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
