(4004599, 571737, 58691, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. without a roundabout, that looks like one dangerous intersection. I also see a starfish and subdivisions. :) <br/> <br/>I think you could''ve added a bit more contrast in post production. <br/> <br/>Good shot though.</td>', 'Nice capture. without a roundabout, that looks like one dangerous intersection. I also see a starfish and subdivisions. :)  I think you could''ve added a bit more contrast in post production.  Good shot though.', '2007-08-16 15:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
