(4004647, 570108, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not really a landscape per se. Needs a bit of straighening in my opinion. Its a touching scene and fairly well composed.  It just needs some more oompf</td>', 'Not really a landscape per se. Needs a bit of straighening in my opinion. Its a touching scene and fairly well composed.  It just needs some more oompf', '2007-08-16 16:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
