(4005579, 570192, 37930, '<td valign="top">Strange, I thought I voted on this one already. Maybe there''s two that are very similar. Buildings are a little too dark to really distinguish between them. A longer exposure probably would have helped, then you could have darkened the blues in PP to retain the nice blue in the sky.<br/> <br/>Anyways, you made it look fairly nice, which is quite a feat considering it''s Calgary. Go Oilers! (My prejudice doesn''t affect my vote =)<br/> <br/>P.S Just keeping the rivalry alive, no offense intended.</td>', 'Strange, I thought I voted on this one already. Maybe there''s two that are very similar. Buildings are a little too dark to really distinguish between them. A longer exposure probably would have helped, then you could have darkened the blues in PP to retain the nice blue in the sky. Anyways, you made it look fairly nice, which is quite a feat considering it''s Calgary. Go Oilers! (My prejudice doesn''t affect my vote =) P.S Just keeping the rivalry alive, no offense intended.', '2007-08-16 23:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005581, 571270, 82282, '<td valign="top">This photograph really caught my eye.  Not seeing the kid''s facial expression has got me thinking is he scared?  What caught his attention to cause him to turn around like that?  Nice shot!</td>', 'This photograph really caught my eye.  Not seeing the kid''s facial expression has got me thinking is he scared?  What caught his attention to cause him to turn around like that?  Nice shot!', '2007-08-16 23:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
