(4007381, 571982, 80058, '<td valign="top">You captured a great pattern here with the building, to me (but then again I like the abstract thing) would''ve been better if you cropped so tightly you could only see parts of the building and windows. Doubt it would''ve scored well if you did that tho, just my personal taste!</td>', 'You captured a great pattern here with the building, to me (but then again I like the abstract thing) would''ve been better if you cropped so tightly you could only see parts of the building and windows. Doubt it would''ve scored well if you did that tho, just my personal taste!', '2007-08-17 17:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
