(4007495, 570046, 80058, '<td valign="top">I really wonder how this is gonna go, I''m clueless to what does well here and what it doesn''t haahhahahahahaha I gotta say I''m definetly giving you a 10 because of your originality in this shot. Everything about it works, to me its a perfect representation of a busy city! Hope it gets top 10! =D Good luck!</td>', 'I really wonder how this is gonna go, I''m clueless to what does well here and what it doesn''t haahhahahahahaha I gotta say I''m definetly giving you a 10 because of your originality in this shot. Everything about it works, to me its a perfect representation of a busy city! Hope it gets top 10! =D Good luck!', '2007-08-17 18:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
