(4008161, 571382, 61012, '<td valign="top">One of my favs of the challenge. Very moody. I also like how the colors in the water are almost rainbow-like. Very nice capture</td>', 'One of my favs of the challenge. Very moody. I also like how the colors in the water are almost rainbow-like. Very nice capture', '2007-08-17 23:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
