(4008744, 570449, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot - love the glimpses of life in the boxes.</td>', 'Great shot - love the glimpses of life in the boxes.', '2007-08-18 07:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4008746, 570439, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well suited to B&amp;W - I like the kinda crowded nature of the shot, yet it all hangs together quite nicely.</td>', 'Well suited to B&W - I like the kinda crowded nature of the shot, yet it all hangs together quite nicely.', '2007-08-18 07:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4008747, 568339, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  They get, what, 5 gallons to the mile?  :-)  Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'LOL!  They get, what, 5 gallons to the mile?  :-)  Nice take on the challenge.', '2007-08-18 07:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4008748, 571483, 30982, '<td valign="top">And those wheeled ones are planning an attack!!  Nifty perspective.</td>', 'And those wheeled ones are planning an attack!!  Nifty perspective.', '2007-08-18 07:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4008749, 570725, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lines.  I get a feeling of despondency rather than upward climbing.</td>', 'Wonderful lines.  I get a feeling of despondency rather than upward climbing.', '2007-08-18 07:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009106, 571308, 66952, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, the arch, and the feel of movement in the water. I especially like the lines leading to the city, then across to the arch. My eye keeps getting drawn to the blown out lights on the bridge though. Balancing the lights and sky is one of the things I struggle with when I do night photography too. You might be able to solve that by shooting a few minutes earlier (assuming this is evening). But otherwise, very nice.</td>', 'I like the composition, the arch, and the feel of movement in the water. I especially like the lines leading to the city, then across to the arch. My eye keeps getting drawn to the blown out lights on the bridge though. Balancing the lights and sky is one of the things I struggle with when I do night photography too. You might be able to solve that by shooting a few minutes earlier (assuming this is evening). But otherwise, very nice.', '2007-08-18 12:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009111, 571693, 66952, '<td valign="top">Wow! I''ve lived in the desert all my life. Stuff like this just doesn''t happen in my world. Very interesting shot.</td>', 'Wow! I''ve lived in the desert all my life. Stuff like this just doesn''t happen in my world. Very interesting shot.', '2007-08-18 12:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009114, 571456, 66952, '<td valign="top">It took some time for me to notice what the real subject of this shot is. This is a great idea, and the fisheye effect is perfect for it. I wonder if there''s some way you could make it more obvious for simpleminded folk like me.</td>', 'It took some time for me to notice what the real subject of this shot is. This is a great idea, and the fisheye effect is perfect for it. I wonder if there''s some way you could make it more obvious for simpleminded folk like me.', '2007-08-18 12:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009121, 571819, 66952, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know there were so many DPCers in St. Louis. Lots of arches in this challenge, from every angle possible. I like how the ends of the arch end up on the top of the buildings, kind of like the pot of gold at the end of the rainbow.</td>', 'I didn''t know there were so many DPCers in St. Louis. Lots of arches in this challenge, from every angle possible. I like how the ends of the arch end up on the top of the buildings, kind of like the pot of gold at the end of the rainbow.', '2007-08-18 12:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009135, 571823, 66952, '<td valign="top">A lovely silhouette. Did you enter this in the right challenge?</td>', 'A lovely silhouette. Did you enter this in the right challenge?', '2007-08-18 12:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009289, 571693, 56441, '<td valign="top">Very clever!</td>', 'Very clever!', '2007-08-18 14:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009304, 571778, 56441, '<td valign="top">Shouldnt this be in the Rural challenge?</td>', 'Shouldnt this be in the Rural challenge?', '2007-08-18 14:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009595, 571953, 37930, '<td valign="top">The only thing I might have done differently is rotate the image so the large building on the left was straight. Other than that I''ve got no complaints about this one.</td>', 'The only thing I might have done differently is rotate the image so the large building on the left was straight. Other than that I''ve got no complaints about this one.', '2007-08-18 18:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009610, 571738, 37930, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured. Theres a good sense of depth in this image; the bridge almost appears three dimensional. The trees on the far side are a bit dark, and so it makes it a bit difficult to distinguish details, for instance the black building that isn''t immediately recognisable. Maybe selective color could have fixed that? Or using channel mixer to convert to B&amp;W? I don''t know. I like it regardless of that.</td>', 'Nicely captured. Theres a good sense of depth in this image; the bridge almost appears three dimensional. The trees on the far side are a bit dark, and so it makes it a bit difficult to distinguish details, for instance the black building that isn''t immediately recognisable. Maybe selective color could have fixed that? Or using channel mixer to convert to B&W? I don''t know. I like it regardless of that.', '2007-08-18 18:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009618, 569595, 37930, '<td valign="top">I think it would have looked a bit cooler if the boardwalk (or whatever) was horizontally straight. But you achieved a nice effect anyways, almost making it look like two images. Just a minor quibble though, and overall a great image IMO.</td>', 'I think it would have looked a bit cooler if the boardwalk (or whatever) was horizontally straight. But you achieved a nice effect anyways, almost making it look like two images. Just a minor quibble though, and overall a great image IMO.', '2007-08-18 18:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009621, 571486, 37930, '<td valign="top">The colors and contrast are spectacular for a basic editing challenge. It almost looks like HDR. Very well done.</td>', 'The colors and contrast are spectacular for a basic editing challenge. It almost looks like HDR. Very well done.', '2007-08-18 18:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009834, 571933, 77196, '<td valign="top">The building with the pyramid top is not parallel to the side of the photo (nor is the light post. I think this would have more impact if the main feature vertical was parallel to the side, and the other lines as they fit. Still, this is a nice shot.</td>', 'The building with the pyramid top is not parallel to the side of the photo (nor is the light post. I think this would have more impact if the main feature vertical was parallel to the side, and the other lines as they fit. Still, this is a nice shot.', '2007-08-18 20:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009839, 571839, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too much shadow in the foreground pushes the viewer away from the photo rather than drawing them in. Nice skyline in the background - may be worth trying to zoom in to focus on that.</td>', 'Too much shadow in the foreground pushes the viewer away from the photo rather than drawing them in. Nice skyline in the background - may be worth trying to zoom in to focus on that.', '2007-08-18 20:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4009922, 570192, 78115, '<td valign="top">nice shot ,did you two have coffee that morning</td>', 'nice shot ,did you two have coffee that morning', '2007-08-18 21:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010235, 571303, 31720, '<td valign="top">The blackness at the bottom of the photo seems like wasted space. Cropping it out would but the line of symmetry between the bridge and the reflection at the center of the picture, emphasizing it.</td>', 'The blackness at the bottom of the photo seems like wasted space. Cropping it out would but the line of symmetry between the bridge and the reflection at the center of the picture, emphasizing it.', '2007-08-19 01:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010404, 571273, 56696, '<td valign="top">snap, this is legit.</td>', 'snap, this is legit.', '2007-08-19 04:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010407, 571956, 56696, '<td valign="top">holy shit.. this isn''t that urban but it gets a 10 anyways. If you don''t win i''ll just give up on people all together.</td>', 'holy shit.. this isn''t that urban but it gets a 10 anyways. If you don''t win i''ll just give up on people all together.', '2007-08-19 04:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010408, 570981, 56696, '<td valign="top">not a landscape at all?</td>', 'not a landscape at all?', '2007-08-19 04:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010409, 570783, 56696, '<td valign="top">i love the juxtaposition of the natural/industrial. well done. <br/> <br/>I give it an 8 just because I think it''s a bit overexposed.</td>', 'i love the juxtaposition of the natural/industrial. well done.  I give it an 8 just because I think it''s a bit overexposed.', '2007-08-19 04:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010411, 571693, 56696, '<td valign="top">haha</td>', 'haha', '2007-08-19 04:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4010412, 571427, 56696, '<td valign="top">woah, this is incredible. The composition is perfect and I can really feel the sense of motion. props and a 10.</td>', 'woah, this is incredible. The composition is perfect and I can really feel the sense of motion. props and a 10.', '2007-08-19 04:20:42.000000', NULL, 1);
