(4010926, 570981, 75162, '<td valign="top">I bet that many people will tell you that you picture is blurry, in case you didn''t notice! :D<br/>For me the blur(or the sharpness) tells a story, as well as the light, or the composition.<br/>This picture tells the story of the "urban underworld", as does the picture "underland(scape)". this is a world of blurs and anonymity!</td>', 'I bet that many people will tell you that you picture is blurry, in case you didn''t notice! :DFor me the blur(or the sharpness) tells a story, as well as the light, or the composition.This picture tells the story of the "urban underworld", as does the picture "underland(scape)". this is a world of blurs and anonymity!', '2007-08-19 12:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
