(4013120, 569915, 77315, '<td valign="top">Great picture, and good reflection in the water. The tiny sky at the top of the left house is a little distracting</td>', 'Great picture, and good reflection in the water. The tiny sky at the top of the left house is a little distracting', '2007-08-20 02:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
