(4013137, 569913, 77315, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic sky, and a lot of constrast between the buildings - those are good things IMO<br/>the houses at the right is a little out of focus, but not much</td>', 'Very dramatic sky, and a lot of constrast between the buildings - those are good things IMOthe houses at the right is a little out of focus, but not much', '2007-08-20 02:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
