(4015849, 572010, 19641, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot but I think it had the potential to be great.  The distortion and the two spots on either side of the clock tower detract from it.  I''m still giving it a decent score but in this challenge I thought others were better.  Hope this was helpful and good luck.</td>', 'This is a nice shot but I think it had the potential to be great.  The distortion and the two spots on either side of the clock tower detract from it.  I''m still giving it a decent score but in this challenge I thought others were better.  Hope this was helpful and good luck.', '2007-08-20 22:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
