(4018838, 569476, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the title. kitschy but still every inch a poem. I suppose it''s the faux horizon in the mirror that really sells me (and also makes it a landscape in my admittedly skewed eyes)<br/> <br/>ok, Posthumous Blue Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'I love the title. kitschy but still every inch a poem. I suppose it''s the faux horizon in the mirror that really sells me (and also makes it a landscape in my admittedly skewed eyes) ok, Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2007-08-21 23:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
