(4019201, 569326, 56880, '<td valign="top">This image looks a little squished to me.  There''s strong lines headed off to the right, but a lot of empty space in the top half of the picture.  You got a pretty good reflection, but otherwise the lighting is fairly harsh.  The contrast on the boat makes it look like it shouldn''t be part of the subject.  Compositionally, the little pier poking in the corner, where the boat itself it cut off, gives a cluttered look to an already detailed image.</td>', 'This image looks a little squished to me.  There''s strong lines headed off to the right, but a lot of empty space in the top half of the picture.  You got a pretty good reflection, but otherwise the lighting is fairly harsh.  The contrast on the boat makes it look like it shouldn''t be part of the subject.  Compositionally, the little pier poking in the corner, where the boat itself it cut off, gives a cluttered look to an already detailed image.', '2007-08-22 01:15:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019204, 570488, 30982, '<td valign="top">First, no bitching about a 7 and no ribbon.  You have more 7''s than 99% of the folks who try to do their best will ever see - most will never see one!  And you have a ribbon or two - you could bitch if it was a 7 with no ribbons at all.  :-)  Second, how do you edit comments DURING the challenge??</td>', 'First, no bitching about a 7 and no ribbon.  You have more 7''s than 99% of the folks who try to do their best will ever see - most will never see one!  And you have a ribbon or two - you could bitch if it was a 7 with no ribbons at all.  :-)  Second, how do you edit comments DURING the challenge??', '2007-08-22 01:15:37.000000', NULL, 0),
