(4019232, 571979, 56880, '<td valign="top">My main issue with this shot is you have too much sidewalk, which isn''t part of your subject (like the reflections) or providing contextual contrast (like the shrubs).  The neon inside disrupts your reflections.  Next time tell the manager not to be so rude and turn off the sign while you''re taking pictures.</td>', 'My main issue with this shot is you have too much sidewalk, which isn''t part of your subject (like the reflections) or providing contextual contrast (like the shrubs).  The neon inside disrupts your reflections.  Next time tell the manager not to be so rude and turn off the sign while you''re taking pictures.', '2007-08-22 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
