(4019792, 571273, 34462, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Ken. I waffled a bit on the reflection, but I think it distracts more than enhances.</td>', 'Nice shot Ken. I waffled a bit on the reflection, but I think it distracts more than enhances.', '2007-08-22 05:41:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019798, 571486, 24111, '<td valign="top">beautiful! Congrats!</td>', 'beautiful! Congrats!', '2007-08-22 05:58:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019807, 571486, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful take of a very pretty city. So cool to see a Swedish town win a ribbon. The yellows are stunning ... you''re making me want to get over my dislike of HDR :-) Adding to my favorites. Congratulations on the ribbon!!</td>', 'This is a beautiful take of a very pretty city. So cool to see a Swedish town win a ribbon. The yellows are stunning ... you''re making me want to get over my dislike of HDR :-) Adding to my favorites. Congratulations on the ribbon!!', '2007-08-22 06:14:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019810, 571199, 82706, '<td valign="top">hey everyone, thank you so much for the nice comments and the posthumous ribbon. this was the first challenge i had ever entered and i''m very happy to have found this website. i''m sure that by doing so my passion for photography will only increase. thanks again.<br/> <br/>and i dont want to be ignorant, but who has the power to give such ribbons and can someone just explain the posthumous ribbon in general. thank you :)</td>', 'hey everyone, thank you so much for the nice comments and the posthumous ribbon. this was the first challenge i had ever entered and i''m very happy to have found this website. i''m sure that by doing so my passion for photography will only increase. thanks again. and i dont want to be ignorant, but who has the power to give such ribbons and can someone just explain the posthumous ribbon in general. thank you :)', '2007-08-22 06:16:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019814, 571479, 36606, '<td valign="top">amazing shot. just perfect. congrats on the ribbon and the score</td>', 'amazing shot. just perfect. congrats on the ribbon and the score', '2007-08-22 06:19:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019818, 571479, 67027, '<td valign="top">Don''t comment on here often, but just wanted to say that although two almost identical pictures were submitted in the two challenges, the completely different moods they evoke are testament to the photographer, both in the capture and the PP.<br/> <br/>They are both beautiful, but this one is my favourite.</td>', 'Don''t comment on here often, but just wanted to say that although two almost identical pictures were submitted in the two challenges, the completely different moods they evoke are testament to the photographer, both in the capture and the PP. They are both beautiful, but this one is my favourite.', '2007-08-22 06:22:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019822, 571479, 20608, '<td valign="top">Nice Hatrick of ribbons, all of them totally deserved.</td>', 'Nice Hatrick of ribbons, all of them totally deserved.', '2007-08-22 06:26:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019828, 570449, 3032, '<td valign="top">Very cool!<br/>Lost sight of you after it appeared you were not active here anymore and because I spent less time here. Good to see you back and with cool pics too!</td>', 'Very cool!Lost sight of you after it appeared you were not active here anymore and because I spent less time here. Good to see you back and with cool pics too!', '2007-08-22 06:28:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019848, 571486, 71916, '<td valign="top">Yes it is Helsingborg. I know, I used to live there! Great shot! Denmark is on the other side of the water.</td>', 'Yes it is Helsingborg. I know, I used to live there! Great shot! Denmark is on the other side of the water.', '2007-08-22 06:40:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019852, 571479, 79720, '<td valign="top">Told ya!</td>', 'Told ya!', '2007-08-22 06:42:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019862, 569843, 79720, '<td valign="top">Ecstasy! A ribbon, wow. Thank you to everyone that voted, and all the great comments. I will try to post an out-take that has more of the lake in the frame...in my own final analysis, I felt the sky more than the water.<br/> <br/>Now, how can I possibly follow <i>this</i> act?? Gonna have to set my goals high, I guess.</td>', 'Ecstasy! A ribbon, wow. Thank you to everyone that voted, and all the great comments. I will try to post an out-take that has more of the lake in the frame...in my own final analysis, I felt the sky more than the water. Now, how can I possibly follow this act?? Gonna have to set my goals high, I guess.', '2007-08-22 06:53:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019879, 571427, 79720, '<td valign="top">I cannot believe anybody voted this shot less than the 8 I gave it. A 2 and three 3''s? I think some people must just be cranky.</td>', 'I cannot believe anybody voted this shot less than the 8 I gave it. A 2 and three 3''s? I think some people must just be cranky.', '2007-08-22 07:06:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019926, 569843, 52549, '<td valign="top">VERY impressive shot. WTG David. Congratulations on your first ribbon!</td>', 'VERY impressive shot. WTG David. Congratulations on your first ribbon!', '2007-08-22 07:30:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4019946, 571427, 52549, '<td valign="top">Excellent image, it has a very futuristic look to it. Congratulations on your 4th place and PB.</td>', 'Excellent image, it has a very futuristic look to it. Congratulations on your 4th place and PB.', '2007-08-22 07:39:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4020041, 569714, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not a photo for the masses on DPC for this particular challenge.  Grand vistas were probably more called for regarding a ''landscape''.  You even went against the grain and took this in portrait orientation.  :)<br/> <br/>All that said, I like this for the message, and the truth in what you''ve captured.  It''s really a shame how disgusting, selfish, and thoughtless people can be at times.  No trash can?  No problem.  Somebody else will pick it up.<br/> <br/>"Urban Landscape: Of, relating to, or located in a city."<br/> <br/>I think you did a nice job with this regarding the theme.  It was a top ten pick for me.  Best of luck to you in future challenges.<br/> <br/>Barry</td>', 'Not a photo for the masses on DPC for this particular challenge.  Grand vistas were probably more called for regarding a ''landscape''.  You even went against the grain and took this in portrait orientation.  :) All that said, I like this for the message, and the truth in what you''ve captured.  It''s really a shame how disgusting, selfish, and thoughtless people can be at times.  No trash can?  No problem.  Somebody else will pick it up. "Urban Landscape: Of, relating to, or located in a city." I think you did a nice job with this regarding the theme.  It was a top ten pick for me.  Best of luck to you in future challenges. Barry', '2007-08-22 08:17:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4020056, 569476, 66709, '<td valign="top">very creative to put a picture of the water in a city condo!</td>', 'very creative to put a picture of the water in a city condo!', '2007-08-22 08:25:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4020059, 570046, 30049, '<td valign="top">When I saw this in the challenge, I immediately liked it for the vision the photographer had for urban landscape and a feel for the city (gave it an 8 for what that''s worth).  Helter skelter, noisy, busy, crowded...lots of movement.<br/> <br/>Took some gonads to enter this if you had any interest in a decent score.  Based on your notes in the Photographer''s Comments, it appears you entered this because you liked it. :)<br/> <br/>Kudos to you!  Keep the vision and the passion.<br/> <br/>Take care.<br/>Barry</td>', 'When I saw this in the challenge, I immediately liked it for the vision the photographer had for urban landscape and a feel for the city (gave it an 8 for what that''s worth).  Helter skelter, noisy, busy, crowded...lots of movement. Took some gonads to enter this if you had any interest in a decent score.  Based on your notes in the Photographer''s Comments, it appears you entered this because you liked it. :) Kudos to you!  Keep the vision and the passion. Take care.Barry', '2007-08-22 08:25:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4020129, 569843, 36606, '<td valign="top">stunning photo. Love the drama in the sky! congrats<br/></td>', 'stunning photo. Love the drama in the sky! congrats', '2007-08-22 09:00:05.000000', NULL, 0),
