(4021822, 571341, 62318, '<td valign="top">This should have scored at least a six. It is original. Who says urban has to be about sky scrapers. Urban is vastly different across the globe. This is simplly a superb photo.</td>', 'This should have scored at least a six. It is original. Who says urban has to be about sky scrapers. Urban is vastly different across the globe. This is simplly a superb photo.', '2007-08-22 16:59:07.000000', NULL, 0),
