(4022674, 570046, 22301, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by parma182:</b></div><hr/><i> I take it back, then.  I thought she was referring to off-camera lighting.  I''m admittedly not well versed in that department.  Noted, and bumped up the list of things to learn! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>no problem, it took me a few months to realize this also and I was looking for it. :) glad I could help.</td>', 'Originally posted by parma182: I take it back, then.  I thought she was referring to off-camera lighting.  I''m admittedly not well versed in that department.  Noted, and bumped up the list of things to learn!  no problem, it took me a few months to realize this also and I was looking for it. :) glad I could help.', '2007-08-22 22:38:09.000000', NULL, 0),
