(4043244, 571956, 38267, '<td valign="top">Sick!!!!  Love all your lighting shots.  My brother is a weather fanatic and loves to chase storms.  I had to forward your profile to him.  You gotta love the Colorado thunderstorms!</td>', 'Sick!!!!  Love all your lighting shots.  My brother is a weather fanatic and loves to chase storms.  I had to forward your profile to him.  You gotta love the Colorado thunderstorms!', '2007-08-31 02:44:47.000000', NULL, 0),
