(4051311, 571341, 67697, '<td valign="top">Never again will I complain about living in a small town lol.  I love the metal "trees".  I bet fall is gorgeous there lol.  Very interesting perspective Deb.</td>', 'Never again will I complain about living in a small town lol.  I love the metal "trees".  I bet fall is gorgeous there lol.  Very interesting perspective Deb.', '2007-09-02 23:23:37.000000', NULL, 0),
