(4057826, 570690, 61651, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a top ten, this is a great shot, with an attractive golden glow.  I think the border works well with this.</td>', 'Congratulations on a top ten, this is a great shot, with an attractive golden glow.  I think the border works well with this.', '2007-09-04 18:34:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4057939, 569915, 61651, '<td valign="top">Never occurred to me how much I take this view for granted.  Not until reading the other comments did I realize that without context these lit houses with water for front yards might not make visual sense to others unfamiliar with the area.  Very nice capture of those lights and the water reflections.  Sorry about the rat. :)</td>', 'Never occurred to me how much I take this view for granted.  Not until reading the other comments did I realize that without context these lit houses with water for front yards might not make visual sense to others unfamiliar with the area.  Very nice capture of those lights and the water reflections.  Sorry about the rat. :)', '2007-09-04 19:26:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4057944, 571298, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful crack of dawn shot - I like how that pink sidewalk leads you through the quiet scene.</td>', 'Beautiful crack of dawn shot - I like how that pink sidewalk leads you through the quiet scene.', '2007-09-04 19:27:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4061234, 570439, 62318, '<td valign="top">Interesting post... But i  really like the composition you setup. Some may complain about the bridge blocking the skyline, but i think it really enhances the picture.</td>', 'Interesting post... But i  really like the composition you setup. Some may complain about the bridge blocking the skyline, but i think it really enhances the picture.', '2007-09-05 12:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4066572, 569903, 75153, '<td valign="top">This picture is awesome. If it weren''t for the not text rule, you probably would have gotten first place. And even if the rays were added photoshop, It''s still really sweet. Just read through the rules and keep it up. I can''t wait to see what else you come up with.</td>', 'This picture is awesome. If it weren''t for the not text rule, you probably would have gotten first place. And even if the rays were added photoshop, It''s still really sweet. Just read through the rules and keep it up. I can''t wait to see what else you come up with.', '2007-09-06 20:24:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4070074, 570783, 81852, '<td valign="top">I like the airplane trail. It gives the photo a sense of life in the moment.</td>', 'I like the airplane trail. It gives the photo a sense of life in the moment.', '2007-09-07 18:59:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4082015, 571741, 40718, '<td valign="top">Oooh, party foul.  Your score is over 5.5.  I''ll give you a short critique though.  I like the composition and the sky is a nice color.  Overall it looks like it is either suffering from some mild oversharpening or the lights were bleeding a tiny bit on the exposure.  I see it mainly in the lights on the left building and the "citigroup" sign which is red and may be the issue in itself as red saturates quite quickly on a digital sensor.</td>', 'Oooh, party foul.  Your score is over 5.5.  I''ll give you a short critique though.  I like the composition and the sky is a nice color.  Overall it looks like it is either suffering from some mild oversharpening or the lights were bleeding a tiny bit on the exposure.  I see it mainly in the lights on the left building and the "citigroup" sign which is red and may be the issue in itself as red saturates quite quickly on a digital sensor.', '2007-09-11 19:40:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4084632, 569900, 40718, '<td valign="top">ya, I like this one much better.  The lighting is wonderful.  I still want some breathing room, I think.  You managed both horizontal and vertical levels this time. ;)</td>', 'ya, I like this one much better.  The lighting is wonderful.  I still want some breathing room, I think.  You managed both horizontal and vertical levels this time. ;)', '2007-09-12 13:26:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4086446, 569325, 60862, '<td valign="top">Such pretty light, and the reflection really adds to the shot.  I like the colorful umbrellas, too!</td>', 'Such pretty light, and the reflection really adds to the shot.  I like the colorful umbrellas, too!', '2007-09-13 00:59:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4088361, 571741, 57032, '<td valign="top">A pretty good shot (I especially like the matching lighting colours on each floor of the building on the left), but I love the last of the outtakes. What a sky!</td>', 'A pretty good shot (I especially like the matching lighting colours on each floor of the building on the left), but I love the last of the outtakes. What a sky!', '2007-09-13 22:12:43.000000', NULL, 0),
